# =============================================================================
#  assets/creatures/types.def  —  six types, and only what is NOT neutral
# =============================================================================
#  Written as exceptions rather than as a 6x6 grid on purpose. Thirty-six numbers
#  is thirty-six chances to put a 200 where a 50 belongs, and — worse — a reader
#  cannot tell a deliberate 100 from a forgotten one. Listed this way the file reads
#  as the design: fire beats grass, water beats fire and rock, rock grounds
#  electricity. Everything unsaid is neutral, and saying nothing is unambiguous.
#
#  Percent, not a multiplier, because the whole battle is integer arithmetic. See
#  the header of games/creatures/battle.hpp for why that is not an aesthetic choice.
# =============================================================================
type normal
type fire
type water
type grass
type electric
type rock

eff normal   rock      50

eff fire     fire      50
eff fire     water     50
eff fire     grass    200
eff fire     rock      50

eff water    fire     200
eff water    water     50
eff water    grass     50
eff water    rock     200

eff grass    fire      50
eff grass    water    200
eff grass    grass     50
eff grass    rock     200

eff electric water    200
eff electric grass     50
eff electric electric  50

eff rock     fire     200
eff rock     electric 200
eff rock     rock      50
